/P 454 0 R
/E (As markets mature, it becomes increasingly clear that the enduring value of digital financial infrastructure will not come from excitement alone. It will come from utility. From governance. From resilience. From the ability to perform not only in moments of abundance, but in moments of stress. The future will not be shaped by technologies that are merely innovative.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [25]
>>
