700 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 455 0 R
/E (The United Arab Emirates is emerging as more than a fast-growing center for digital assets, financial innovation, and next-generation infrastructure. It is increasingly positioning itself as an intelligent coordination layer for the future of global finance, a jurisdiction where regulation, infrastructure, capital, and cross-border market connectivity are being assembled into a coherent and institutionally relevant system. This report approaches that role through a central idea: the UAE as the Neural Hub of global Web3 and digital infrastructure.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
701 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 455 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
