/E (The regulatory trajectory of digital assets can be understood across three distinct phases:)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
818 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/E (This progression reflects a broader realisation: sustainable innovation in financial services requires regulatory infrastructure that supports trust at scale.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
819 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/E (The Abu Dhabi Global Market has positioned itself at the forefront of this evolution. Through its Financial Services Regulatory Authority \(FSRA\), ADGM introduced one of the earliest comprehensive regulatory frameworks for digital assets, providing clarity across the full lifecycle of virtual asset activity \(FSRA Virtual Asset Framework\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
