836 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/E (In its early development, the digital asset sector operated within fragmented and often undefined regulatory environments. Legal classifications of digital assets were unclear, and guidance on custody, trading and financial intermediation was limited or absent. This environment enabled rapid experimentation but constrained institutional participation and introduced material risks related to consumer protection, financial crime and operational integrity.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [36]
>>
