1512 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 473 0 R
/E (One of the most important signals from the UAE market is how traditional institutions are approaching digital asset integration. Rather than overhauling their existing infrastructure, leading banks and payment providers are enhancing it. They are adding digital asset capabilities alongside, and often on top of, their core systems.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1513 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 473 0 R
/E (In the UAE, crypto-native companies are enabling local neobanks to offer digital asset services to their customers, creating a model where traditional banks can participate in digital assets through strategic partnerships rather than building from scratch. This may well be the first step toward more traditional banks launching digital asset services through those neobank channels, providing an on-ramp that respects existing risk frameworks while opening new revenue streams.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
