/E (What makes this remarkable is not any single approval but the orchestration. The DFSA, VARA, ADGM, and the Central Bank are operating in coordination, each creating clear guardrails within their respective domains. This multi-pillar approach gives institutions multiple pathways to participate depending on their business model and risk appetite.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
1526 0 obj
<<
