/P 473 0 R
/E (Critically, the UAE Central Bank has been intentional about wanting private, dirham-denominated stablecoins on the market, servicing uniquely UAE business cases, while simultaneously recognizing the vital role of global dollar-denominated stablecoins. )
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [25]
>>
endobj
