/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (For regulators and institutions, maintaining a unified view of ecosystem risk becomes increasingly complex. As a result, supervisory approaches are evolving. Regulators are beginning to explore technology-driven oversight models that aggregate security indicators, transaction patterns, and protocol)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
