>>
endobj
4231 0 obj
<<
/Title (Digital asset custody at Incore was not designed as a standalone product. It was built as a natural extension of capital markets infrastructure: secure, compliant, and fully integrated front to back with core banking, risk management, treasury, and reporting systems. This required deep transformation across existing operations to support a new asset class.)
/Dest [44 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3948 0 R
>>
